= u_pass == 1 ? vec2(1.,0.) : vec2(0.,1.);\n      float r = max(u_p1, .5); float sigma = r * .5;\n      vec4 sum = vec4(0.); float ws = 0.;\n      for (int i = -20; i <= 20; i++) {\n        float x = float(i)/20.0*r; float w = exp(-(x*x)/(2.*sigma*sigma+1e-4));\n        sum += texture(u_tex, v_st + dir*u_texel*x) * w; ws += w;\n      }\n      o = sum / max(ws,1e-4);\n      if (u_pass == 2) o = texture(u_orig, v_st) + o * (u_p2/100.);\n}","keepOrig":true,"id":"glow","rawShader":true}],"transitions":[],"layerTypes":[],"warnings":["Text · 1 · Make: unavailable effect “word-slide-swap” remains inactive, as in the editor. Its editable data is preserved.","Text · 2 · your: unavailable effect “word-slide-swap” remains inactive, as in the editor. Its editable data is preserved.","Powermove · opening: unavailable effect “word-slide-swap” remains inactive, as in the editor. Its editable data is preserved.","gradient editor · entrance: unavailable effect “word-slide-swap” remains inactive, as in the editor. Its editable data is preserved.","Text: unavailable effect “word-slide-swap” remains inactive, as in the editor. Its editable data is preserved.","Font “Geist” is not bundled. Supply this font in your app to preserve text layout."]}